{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"SECRET = INT(RND(100)+1)\n\nTRIES=1\nMainloop:\n\tINPUT \"Guess a number between 1 and 100\", nr\n\tIF nr=\"\"\n\t\tGOTO Mainloop\n\tENDIF\n    GUESS = INT(nr)\n    IF GUESS = SECRET\n      GOTO END\n    ENDIF\n    IF GUESS > SECRET\n       PRINT GUESS & \" is too high\"\n    ENDIF\n    IF GUESS < SECRET\n       PRINT GUESS & \" is too low\"\n    ENDIF\n    INC TRIES\n Goto Mainloop\n\nEND:\n    PRINT \"---------- You got it in \" & TRIES & \" guesses ----------\"\n","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}